case-organizer (4.8.1) stable; urgency=high

  * Manage Case subcategory taxonomy — completeness fix. Independent
    interlocutory applications that stand apart from the main suit (and carry
    their own appealable order) are now first-class subcategories rather than
    "misc": Rejection of Plaint (Order VII Rule 11), Return of Plaint (Order
    VII Rule 10), Setting Aside Ex Parte Decree (Order IX Rule 13), Restoration
    / Setting Aside Dismissal (Order IX Rule 9), Setting Aside Ex Parte Order
    (Order IX Rule 7), Judgment on Admissions (Order XII Rule 6), Preliminary
    Issue (Order XIV Rule 2), Substitution / Abatement (Order XXII), Withdrawal
    / Compromise (Order XXIII), Review (Order XLVII), Transfer (Section 24),
