    written statement → issues → evidence (Order XVIII Rule 4) → arguments →
    judgment), Criminal (CrPC / BNSS stages, discharge, and the Section 311 /
    319 / 451 / 457 / 91 applications) and Commercial (Commercial Courts Act:
    Section 12A pre-institution mediation, Order XV-A case management, Order
    XIII-A summary judgment, Order XI disclosure). These are available to both
    sides: the respondent (who files Order VII Rule 11 and the discharge /
    defence applications) sees the responsive pleadings PLUS every common
    interlocutory and trial-stage group — not just the responsive pleadings.
