    always rendering dark. Light-mode overrides remap bento's custom gray
    palette variables and the component classes that hardcode Tailwind's
    default hex (tool cards, category filters, panels, pills, shortcut keys,
    etc.), scoped to the tool shell and to light mode; dark mode is
